## Configuration

### Browser Settings
gstack creates isolated browser instances in `.gstack/` directory:
```typescript
// Automatic browser configuration
{
  userDataDir: '.gstack/browser-data',
  headless: false, // for debugging

  "aigcDetection": {
    "provider": "gptzero",
    "apiKey": "...",
    "endpoint": "https://api.gptzero.me/v2/predict/text"
  }
}
```
